5. STATUS OF THE DATA

   All restaurant listings contained in this repository are SAMPLE DATA
   created for academic demonstration. Restaurant names are fictional, and
   ratings, prices, review counts and review text are generated. They do not
   describe, represent or evaluate any real business. The per-user interaction
   data used in the evaluation is likewise synthetic, because public
   restaurant catalogues carry no per-user rating history. No figure reported
   in this repository should be interpreted as a measurement of any real-world
   establishment or of real user behaviour.


